t("Shadow Combat", "Sombra Combat", "talent name")
t("Shadow Cunning", "Shadow Astucia", "talent name")
t("Your preparations give you greater magical capabilities. You gain a bonus to Spellpower equal to %d%% of your Cunning (Current bonus: %d).", "Tus preparativos te dan mayores capacidades mágicas. Usted gana un bono a Spellpower igual a  %d %% de su Cunning (Bono actual:  %d  ).", "tformat")
t("Shadow Feed", "Sombra Alimentar", "talent name")
t("Shadowstep", "o Shadowstep", "talent name")
t("You require to be able to move to use this talent.", "Necesitas poder moverte para usar este talento.", "logPlayer")
t("You cannot do that currently.", "No puedes hacer eso ahora.", "logPlayer")
t("You do not have line of sight.", "No tienes línea de visión.", "logSeen")
t("The spell fizzles!", "¡El hechizo brilla!", "logSeen")
